# jemdoc: menu{MENU}{index.html}
= Kurt Braunlich, Ph.D.

~~~
{}{raw}

<div>
    <p style="float: left; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;"><img src="imgs/biopicog.png" height="227.1" width="309.9" border="1px"></p>
    <p>I am a research fellow in the <a href="https://www.nimh.nih.gov/research/research-conducted-at-nimh/research-areas/clinics-and-labs/lbc/slp/index.shtml">Section on Learning and Plasticity</a> at <a href="https://www.nimh.nih.gov/index.shtml">NIMH</a> and the <a href="https://www.nei.nih.gov/research-and-training/research-labs-and-branches/laboratory-sensorimotor-research">Laboratory of Sensorimotor Research</a> at the <a href="https://www.nei.nih.gov/">NEI</a>. My doctoral and postdoctoral work examined the neural and computational principles of category learning and decision-making in humans. I now develop quantitative methods for translating functional brain responses across species.</p>
    

</div>

